        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Spam musubi, Spam, Treet\n- Companies: Hormel Foods Corporation, Armour/Pinnacle Foods\n- Places: Hawaii, USA\n- Concepts: Japanese omusubi\n\nFacts:\n- Spam is a brand of canned cooked meat made by Hormel Foods Corporation.\n- Treet is a canned meat product similar to Spam that Armour/Pinnacle Foods markets in the USA.\n- Spam musubi is a popular snack and lunch food in Hawaii made from a slice of grilled Spam on top of a block of rice, wrapped with nori in the tradition of Japanese omusubi.",
